func (s *{{ .Prefix }}Service) Delete{{ .Prefix }}(ctx context.Context, req *gohan.Request[{{ .Prefix | toSnake }}v1.Delete{{ .Prefix }}Request]) (*gohan.Response[{{ .Prefix | toSnake }}v1.Delete{{ .Prefix }}Response], error) {
    id := int(req.Msg.Id)

    var item migrations.{{ .Prefix }}
    if err := s.db.FindOne(&item, "id = ?", id); err != nil {
